Cell["\<\
The most important one for daily usage is the alias; the Welcome[] wizard \
walks a new user through choosing one permanently. From then on all their \
data entries naturally live in:\
\>", "MathCaption",
 CellID->2065,ExpressionUUID->"45133455-01f1-448b-adaa-dc0633914bc1"],

