SolutionsXDemo/YourName\"\>"], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[8]=",
 CellID->2067,ExpressionUUID->"8ab0b742-3bac-4fbc-86b3-33f29abeb9c2"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
The curator flag is reserved for power users who wish to contribute their \
data entries to the public repository. Contact vasildimi@gmail.com if you \
wish to become a curator.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->2068,ExpressionUUID->"1d829e92-bf9a-4324-9b1a-b0ef96bb4594"],

