    FontSlant->"Italic",
    FontColor->GrayLevel[0.45]]]}]], "DefinitionBox",
 CellID->2080,ExpressionUUID->"0b7deb0b-97d3-4981-ac44-bb44378584f8"],

Cell["\<\
Sol as soon as the record carries a chart; Thr \[LongDash] a theory \
\[LongDash] while it does not.\
\>", "Item",
 CellID->2081,ExpressionUUID->"10e03759-5c44-42dd-9446-dfae59d52706"],

Cell["\<\
The signature letter comes from the first metric \[LongDash] L Lorentzian, E \
Euclidean \[LongDash] and is absent when there is no metric, as is the whole \
chart segment for theories.\
\>", "Item",
 CellID->2082,ExpressionUUID->"43daca1e-d2ce-4b9b-a31f-11d2db178ddb"],

Cell["\<\
Only the first manifold, the first metric and the first chart are consulted; \
their Name keys supply the words.\
\>", "Item",
 CellID->2083,ExpressionUUID->"6a1064b3-3497-411c-8616-eac8a9a9b41a"],

Cell["\<\
Renaming the manifold and the chart before the first save is part of \
authoring \[LongDash] a solution left with its theory's manifold name would \
overwrite the theory it came from.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->2084,ExpressionUUID->"185f87ff-9c48-45c7-abb7-e491c8c07183"],

