Cell["\<\
Notice how the coordinate z[] has not been loaded as a proper xAct \
coordinate: the loaded solution is still sol, whose radial coordinate is r[]. \
Similarly zc is not an xAct symbol \[LongDash] it would have been, had we \
loaded Curated/Sol__3dL__Induced-black-hole__FG instead of merely getting it. \
Expressions of a gotten record sit inert until the entry's symbols are live, \
and evaluate correctly on use exactly to the extent that the loaded \
environment supplies them:\
\>", "MathCaption",
 CellID->2131,ExpressionUUID->"a0681d33-38bd-47f9-927d-3a3bcc9ff4de"],

